WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.730
I can't believe it's come to this.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.530
Unbelievable.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.100
How's she doing?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.070
She's already overcome the critical stage.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.540
She should be fine if she
gets some rest for a while.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.970
Thank goodness!

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.370
Thank goodness!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.950
What's going on, Master?

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.800
Hey! What's going on, Master?

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.750
All the actors are finally here.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.080
This is the final stage.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.030
Come...

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:34.690
Eternal Assassin, Yojiro Akizuki.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:46.670
Kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill, kill...

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.760
How foolish!

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:09.430
It's foolish to disobey me!

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.460
It's best to stop it.

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.410
Now you're up next, Leader.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:03.420
The two swords, trained to
strike down the Head...

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:07.150
They now turn to destroy each other.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.290
How foolish.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:12.990
How pitiable.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:04:01.180
If I ever see her again, I promise
I'll kill her in one stroke with my sword!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.240
You can't even kill one woman.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:04.960
It's laughable that you claim to be an assassin.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:10.210
Have you lost the true meaning
of your own mission?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.280
Leader!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.850
Akizuki-sama!

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:26.960
No...

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.100
You must destroy him...

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:35.440
You must destroy the Eternal Assassin!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.710
The negative aura disappeared from the Gaichi!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.410
But I still see the foul star...

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:59.060
Kono tokoro tsuzuiteru nagaame ga
The rain that's been falling for so long

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:07.510
Are you going to let destiny
defeat you this time, Eternal Assassin?

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:05.100
Hayaru kimochi wo osae konde
Restrains my rushing feelings

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:17.080
Togireru koto no nai koukai ga maegami wo yurasu
Never-ending regret sways my bangs

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.340
Show me your true power!

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:13.910
Now!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:23.020
Kurayami yori hito no yasashisa ni ashidome saresoude
It felt like kindness, rather than darkness

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:18.820
No...

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:29.060
Kurayami yori hito no yasashisa ni ashidome saresoude
was going to strand me

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:24.520
No...

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:26.690
No...

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.360
No...

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:33.870
Anata tono yakusoku wo mabuta ni omoi kaeshiteta
I closed my eyes and thought about

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.430
No...

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:41.240
Anata tono yakusoku wo mabuta ni omoi kaeshiteta
the promise I repeatedly made with you

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.870
No!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.210
Namida
Tears

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:49.750
Namida no shizuku ga ochite
Teardrops fall

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:55.290
Kuchikaketa tsuki ga ukanda
The decayed moon appears

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:57.260
Namida
Tears

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:01.790
Namida ga tsutaeru subete wo
I don't want to miss any of the messages

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:09.030
Hitotsu mo nogasanai kimochi de
That the tears bring

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.000
Namida
Tears

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.470
Namida no shizuku ga koborete
Teardrops fall

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:22.110
Yogiri ga tsuki ni yorisou
And night fog leans on the moon

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:23.920
Namida
Tears

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.420
Namida ga ashiato wo terasu
Teardrops shine in my footsteps

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:39.300
Anata ni chikazukeru ki ga suru
It makes me feel like I can get close to you

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:19.000
I guess this is it.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:25.170
Let the curtain rise on the real play.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.340
Akizuki-sama...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.710
Take this.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.060
Leader!

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.390
Leader.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.870
My destiny ends right here.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.480
I'll take this katana.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.170
I'll promise that I'll seal the Head
this time for sure!

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.250
Yojiro...

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:15.720
It looks like you've finally realized
the truth of your destiny.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.060
The only thing left for you is to seal
the Head of the Conqueror.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:28.070
The Head has lost its Vessel.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.870
At this rate its power will be exhausted.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:45.560
I see you are anxious because
you lost your vessel, Conqueror.

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.350
Then use me!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:55.060
I shall respond to your desire!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:09.940
After all it was me who'd waited
for this very moment!

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:17.290
Now! Now is the time!
Possess me, Conqueror!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:33.300
What? He himself initiated it...

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:37.370
Become one with the Head of the Conqueror...

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:41.130
In order to overwrite history...

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.810
He's gone that far to grant us our desire!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.780
Very impressive, Young One.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.670
The new world.

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.810
The new order.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:18.710
First, let the people hear the celebratory melody.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:31.960
The melody of our 500-year-old grudge!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.500
Enjoy it...

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:38.530
Enjoy it to the fullest!

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.170
Here! Here!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.330
Sing it!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.270
Dance to it!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:53.050
Here! Here!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.580
Twirl around!

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.550
Twirl!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:10.730
Twirl, twirl, twirl, twirl...

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:17.340
I'll scorch this rotten world and rebuild it
in the name of Heaven!

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:25.010
The Land of the Rising Sun...
No, the entire world... shall be reborn!

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:38.760
Have you chosen to become
a demon, Sotetsu Ibaragi?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.410
For my destiny, I'll kill you!

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:02.810
Prepare yourself, Head of the Conqueror!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:17.900
He's too far...

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:40.050
You can never beat me like that!

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:44.760
Fight for your life, Eternal Assassin!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.000
You're not getting away!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:08.000
Head of the Conqueror! I shall seal you!

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.230
The star!

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:38.260
Yojiro, you did it!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:49.620
Now I'm free...

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.980
I thank you, Akizuki.

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:05.060
You have severed my 500-year-old destiny...

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:13.940
The construction of an ideal nation
was what my blood desired to begin with.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:21.290
My desire turned history inside out.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:26.220
That bloody destiny created only strife
and deep-seated delusion.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:30.090
Could my destiny, to destroy the world,
come to pass?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.990
Would that be allowed or not?

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.760
I chose you to ask Heaven those questions.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:42.030
Because I saw him in you.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:47.770
The man who tried to build the new world,
without relying on the power of the Head.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:55.320
He faced the nation and the world
with his own power.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.060
The Head of the Conqueror, huh?

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:10.130
I'm sorry to tell you this, but I don't need...
no, the world doesn't need such a thing.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:17.000
Are you saying that you can't follow
the same path as me?

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.040
I'll forge my own path.

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.210
That's all there is to it.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.850
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.850
What's burdening you, Ibaragi?

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.780
If you don't put it down quickly,
it's going to crush you.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.190
I wish I could...

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:53.540
Maybe he already knew the fate of a nation that
could only be built with the help of the Head.

00:17:56.480 --> 00:18:04.520
Akizuki, the one who carries over
his strength and his will...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.360
No, the only one who could do it is...

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:54.730
Everything was just a dream...

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:04.110
The curtain now falls on the play
written by Sotetsu Ibaragi.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:11.360
It is the 18th day of the fifth month,
in the second year of the Meiji Era.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.160
Goryokaku falls.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:19.930
The Boshin War, which lasted
over a year, has ended.

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:28.470
Two Months Later

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.110
I know this... I remember this...

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.280
It's been so long, Lord Shoten.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:44.950
Are you okay with this?

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.860
They should forge their own paths.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:54.120
And we just let them go. That's good enough.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.630
Come one, come all!

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.380
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:13.040
We're the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:17.750
Hey, where's Shiranui?

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:20.060
You know, his usual place.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.060
You know,

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:22.390
his usual place.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.750
I'm here again!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.530
Tayu!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:29.490
"Mama"!

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.830
Yes, thank you for your business!

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:42.010
I've decided to settle our troupe here.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:50.840
The troupe and I will be waiting for your return
no matter how long it takes.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:53.860
Oh yeah!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.560
There's something I haven't told you
yet, Akizuki-sama.

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:03.730
Kakunojo Yuyama is my stage name.

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.570
My real name is...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.710
You can tell me that next time.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.620
Please take care.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:34.470
Sono te wa ai no tsurugi
The hand is the sword of love

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:43.340
Subete no hajimari no akashi
It proves the beginning of all

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:50.470
Hikaru sora no hate
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:55.310
Yume wa mada maboroshi
The dream is still an illusion

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:59.660
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi
Running on the path

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:07.130
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:12.940
Chigireta ai no tsurugi
The torn sword of love

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:20.470
Subete no hajimari no akashi
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:30.720
Ima koso shinjiru michi wo massugu susume
Now go straight on the path that you believe in

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:36.780
Kono sora ga aru kagiri
As long as this sky exists...

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:44.200
Kono ai ga aru kagiri
As long as this love exists...

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:10.550
Ryoma...

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:15.770
the world, that which exists beyond this sea,
the world you never got to behold...

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:19.070
I'll go out there and see it with my own eyes!

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:27.670
<i>TO GO</i>
<i>TOWARDS</i>
<i>THE SEA</i>

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:32.510
<i>THE END</i>
